            "body": "since we restored `g:loaded_nvim_dir_plugin`, now i'm wondering if we can just restore this in `runtime/plugin/dir.lua` : \n\n```lua\nif vim.fn.mapcheck('-', 'n') == '' and vim.fn.hasmapto('<Plug>(nvim-dir-up)', 'n') == 0 then\n  vim.keymap.set('n', '-', '<Plug>(nvim-dir-up)', { silent = true, desc = 'Open parent directory' })\nend\n```\n\nor was there some other ordering edge-case i'm forgetting ?",
